# No server secrets in git

Never commit or push:
- `.p12`, `.pem`, `.crt`, `.key` files
- `Assets/StreamingAssets/local-config.json` (real values)
- `Assets/StreamingAssets/takclient.p12`
- Real TAK hostnames, passwords, or backend URLs in source code

Safe pattern:
- Committed defaults stay empty or use `example.com` placeholders
- Real values go in gitignored `Assets/StreamingAssets/local-config.json`
- Enrolled cert at `Assets/StreamingAssets/takclient.p12` (gitignored)

Before any `git push`, run:
```powershell
.\ci\verify-no-secrets.ps1
```

Public GitHub Release APKs must be built from a clean checkout (no
`local-config.json` / `takclient.p12`). Enrolled-cert APKs for your headset
stay local-only (`ci/build-android.ps1` on your machine).
